hadiths[45]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1292","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Mere paas budhi oontni thi mere hisse mein se ghaneemat ke din Badr mein. Aur Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne mujhe khums mein se budhi oontni di thi. Phir jab main ne irada kiya ke main Fatima bint Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se ghar basaun, to main ne Bani Qainuqa mein se ek sunar mard se wada kiya ke wo mere sath kooch kare. Phir hum izkhir layein. Main ne irada kiya ke use sunaron ko bechun aur us se apni shadi ke walime mein madad lun. Phir jab main apni dono oontniyon ke liye qutb, boriyan aur rassiyon mein se saman jama kar raha tha, jabke meri dono oontniyan Ansar mein se ek mard ke hujre ke pehlu mein bithi thein, to main lauta jab main ne jo jama kiya jama kiya. Phir meri dono oontniyon ke kohan kaate gaye they, un ke pehlu phaade gaye they, un ke kalejon mein se liya gaya tha. Phir main apni aankhein na rok saka jab main ne un ka ye manzar dekha. Phir main ne kaha: Ye kis ne kiya? To unhon ne kaha: Hamza bin Abd al-Muttalib ne kiya. Wo is ghar mein Ansar ke sharabiyon mein hain. Phir main chala yahan tak ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas dakhil hua jabke Aap ke paas Zaid bin Haritha they. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne mere chehre mein jo mujhe mila pehchana. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Tumhe kya hua? To main ne arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Main ne aaj jaisa kabhi nahi dekha. Hamza ne meri dono oontniyon par hamla kiya aur un ke kohan kaate aur un ke pehlu phaade. Aur wo hain, ghar mein us ke sath sharabi hain. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne apni chadar mangwayi aur odhi. Phir chalte hue chale. Aur main aur Zaid bin Haritha Aap ke peechhe chale. Yahan tak ke us ghar aaye jismein Hamza they. Phir ijazat mangi. Phir unhon ne Aap ko ijazat di. Phir wo sharabi they. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Hamza ko us mein jo us ne kiya malamat karne lage. Phir Hamza nashe mein they, un ki dono aankhein surkh thein. Phir Hamza ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki taraf dekha. Phir nazar upar uthayi. Phir Aap ke ghutne ki taraf dekha. Phir nazar upar uthayi. Phir Aap ki naaf ki taraf dekha. Phir nazar upar uthayi. Phir Aap ke chehre ki taraf dekha. Phir Hamza ne kaha: Kya tum mere baap ke ghulamon ke siwa ho? Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne pehchana ke wo nashe mein hain. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) apni ediyon par peechhe hate aur nikle. Aur hum Aap ke sath nikle."
"1293","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main qaum ko Abu Talha ke ghar mein pilata tha. Aur un ki sharab us din fadikh thi. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne munadi ko hukm diya jo pukarta tha: Suno! Beshak sharab haram ho gayi hai. Unhon ne kaha: Phir Abu Talha ne mujh se kaha: Niklo aur use bahao. Phir main nikla aur use bahaya. Phir wo Madina ki galiyon mein behne lagi. Phir qaum mein se kuchh ne kaha: Qaum qatl ki gayi jabke wo un ke peton mein thi. Phir Allah ne ye nazil farmaya [iman walon aur nek amal karne walon par us mein koi gunah nahi jo unhon ne khaya] ayat tak."
"1294","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne kishmish, khajoor, bussr aur tari khajoor se mana farmaya."
"1295","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Qatada (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne mana farmaya ke khajoor aur zahw, khajoor aur kishmish jama kiye jayein. Aur un mein se har ek ko alag nabeez banaya jaye."
"1296","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Dubba aur muzaffat mein nabeez na banao."
"1297","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne dubba aur muzaffat se mana farmaya."
"1298","[AI-translation] Umm al-Muminin Hazrat Aisha se Ibrahim ke hawale se riwayat hai, main ne Aswad se kaha: Kya tum ne Umm al-Muminin Aisha se poochha ke kis mein nabeez banana na-pasand kiya jata hai? To unhon ne kaha: Haan. Main ne kaha: Umm al-Muminin! Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne kis mein nabeez banane se mana farmaya? Unhon ne kaha: Aap ne hamein is mein mana farmaya, ghar walon ko, ke hum dubba aur muzaffat mein nabeez banayein. Main ne kaha: Kya unhon ne ghada aur hantam ka zikr na kiya? Unhon ne kaha: Main to tumhe wo bayan karta hun jo main ne suna. Main wo bayan karun jo main ne nahi suna?"
"1299","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Aur main tumhe dubba, hantam, naqeer aur muzaffat se manع karta hun."
"1300","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne mashkeezon se mana farmaya to Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se kaha gaya: Har shakhs mashkeeza nahi pata. Phir Aap ne unhe ghair roghn ghade mein ijazat di."
"1301","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Har sharab jo nashe mein kare haram hai."
"1302","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Musa aur Muadh (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Abu Musa aur Muadh ko Yemen ki taraf bheja. To Aap ne farmaya: Aasani karo, sakhti na karo. Khush-khabri do, nafrat na dilao. Baham muwafiqat karo. Phir Abu Musa ne kaha: Ya Nabiullah! Beshak hamari zameen mein jau ki sharab hai, mizr. Aur shehed ki sharab hai, bit'. To Aap ne farmaya: Har nashe wali haram hai."
"1303","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jo duniya mein sharab piye phir us se tauba na kare wo Aakhirat mein us se mehroom hoga."
"1304","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sahl bin Sa'd (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Abu Usaid al-Sa'idi ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko apni shadi mein bulaya. Aur un ki biwi us din un ki khadima thein, jabke wo dulhan thein. Sahl ne kaha: Kya tum jante ho unhon ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko kya pilaya? Unhon ne raat mein Aap ke liye khajoorein bhigoyein. Phir jab Aap ne khaya to unhon ne Aap ko pilaya."
"1305","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sahl (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab Abu Usaid al-Sa'idi dulha bane to unhon ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) aur Aap ke sahaba ko bulaya. Phir unhon ne un ke liye khana na banaya na un ke paas rakha, magar un ki biwi Umm Usaid ne raat mein pathar ke bartan mein khajoorein bhigoyein. Phir jab Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) khane se farigh hue to unhon ne Aap ke liye use hilaya. Phir Aap ko pilaya, Aap ko is se tohfa dete hue."
"1306","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sahl bin Sa'd (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se Arab ki ek aurat ka zikr hua. Phir Aap ne Abu Usaid al-Sa'idi ko hukm diya ke us ki taraf bhejein. Phir unhon ne us ki taraf bheja. Phir wo aayi. Phir Bani Sa'ida ke qile mein utri. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) nikle yahan tak ke us ke paas aaye. Phir us ke paas dakhil hue. Phir ek aurat thi jis ne apna sar jhukaya tha. Phir jab Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne us se kalam kiya to us ne kaha: Main tum se Allah ki panah mangti hun. To Aap ne farmaya: Main ne tumhe mujh se panah di. Phir unhon ne us se kaha: Kya tum janti ho ye kaun hai? Unhon ne kaha: Nahi. Unhon ne kaha: Ye Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) hain jo tumhe paigham dene aaye hain. Unhon ne kaha: Main is se zyada bad-naseeb thi. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) us din aaye yahan tak ke Bani Sa'ida ke saqife mein baithe, Wo aur Aap ke sahaba. Phir farmaya: Hamein pilao ae Sahl! Phir main un ke liye ye pyala lekar nikla. Phir unhe us mein pilaya [rawi ne kaha]: Phir Sahl ne hamein wo pyala nikala. Phir hum ne us mein se piya. Unhon ne kaha: Phir is ke baad Umar bin Abd al-Aziz ne use manga. Phir unhon ne use unhe hadiya kiya."
"1307","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Bakr Siddiq se Abu Ishaq ke hawale se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Bara (raziyallahu anhu) ko kehte suna, unhon ne kaha: Jab Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Madina ki taraf aaye to Aap ke peechhe Suraqa bin Malik bin Ju'shum laga. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne us par bad-dua farmayi. Phir us ka ghoda us se dhans gaya. Unhon ne kaha: Mere liye Allah se dua farmayiye aur main tumhe nuqsan nahi dunga. Phir Aap ne us ke liye dua farmayi. Unhon ne kaha: Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) pyase hue. Phir Aap charwahe ke paas se guzre. Abu Bakr ne kaha: Phir main ne pyala liya aur us mein doodh ki teh duhi. Phir Aap ke paas laya. Phir Aap ne piya yahan tak ke main raazi ho gaya."
"1308","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas us raat jab Aap ko sair karayi gayi, Iliya mein sharab aur doodh ke do pyale laye gaye. Phir Aap ne un dono ki taraf dekha. Phir doodh liya. Jibreel ne kaha: Allah ki hamd hai jis ne tumhe fitrat ki hidayat di. Agar tum sharab lete to tumhari ummat gumrah ho jati."
"1309","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ansar mein se ek mard Abu Humaid Naqi se bartan lekar Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaya. To Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Kya tum ne use dhanka nahi? Agarche us par lakdi aade rakho."
"1310","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jab raat ka ibtida ho ya tum shaam karo to apne bachchon ko roko. Kyunke shaitan us waqt phailte hain. Phir jab raat ki ek ghadi jaye to unhe chhoro. Aur darwaze band karo aur Allah ka naam lo. Kyunke shaitan band darwaza nahi kholta."
"1311","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Apne gharon mein aag na chhoro jab tum so jao."
"1312","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Musa (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Madina mein ek ghar raat mein apne walon par jal gaya. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se un ke mamle ki khabar di gayi. Aap ne farmaya: Beshak ye aag tumhari dushman hai. Phir jab tum so jao to use apne se bujha do."
"1313","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umar bin Abi Salama (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki god mein ladka tha. Aur mera hath pyale mein ghoomta tha. To Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne mujh se farmaya: Ae ladke! Allah ka naam lo, apne dayan se khayiye, apne samne se khayiye. Phir ye mera khana raha us ke baad."
"1314","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id al-Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne mashkeezon ke munh modne se mana farmaya, matlab ke un ke munh tode jayein aur us mein se piya jaye."
"1315","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko Zamzam se pilaya. Phir Aap ne piya jabke Wo khade they."
"1316","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Qatada (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi piye to bartan mein saans na le."
"1317","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas se Thumama bin Abdullah ke hawale se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Anas bartan mein do ya teen martaba saans lete, aur dawa karte ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) teen martaba saans lete."
"1318","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) hamare is ghar mein tashreef laye. Phir pani manga. Phir hum ne Aap ke liye hamari ek bakri duhi. Phir use hamare is kunwein ke pani se milaya. Phir Aap ko diya, jabke Abu Bakr Aap ke bayein they, Umar Aap ke samne, dehati Aap ke dayein. Phir jab Aap farigh hue to Umar ne kaha: Ye Abu Bakr hain. Phir Aap ne dehati ko diya. Phir farmaya: Dayan wale, dayan wale. Suno! Dayein se ibtida karo. Anas ne kaha: Phir ye sunnat hai. Phir ye sunnat hai, teen martaba."
"1319","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sahl bin Sa'd (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas pyala laya gaya. Phir Aap ne us mein se piya, jabke Aap ke dayein ladka tha, qaum mein sab se chhota, buzurg Aap ke bayein. To Aap ne farmaya: Ae ladke! Kya tum mujhe ijazat dete ho ke main unhe buzurgon ko dun? Us ne kaha: Main tum se apni fazilat par kisi ko tarjeeh nahi dunga, Ya Rasulullah! Phir Aap ne use de diya."
"1320","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi khaye to apna hath na ponchhe yahan tak ke use chaate ya chatwaye."
"1321","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ansar mein se ek mard aaya jise Abu Shu'aib kaha jata hai. Phir us ne apne qassab ghulam se kaha: Mere liye paanch ka khana banao. Kyunke main Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko paanch mein panchwan bulana chahta hun. Kyunke main ne Aap ke chehre mein bhook pehchani hai. Phir us ne unhe bulaya. Phir un ke sath ek mard aaya. To Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Beshak ye hamare peechhe aaya hai. Phir agar chaho to use ijazat do. Phir use ijazat do. Aur agar chaho to wo laute, lauta. To us ne kaha: Nahi, balke main ne use ijazat di."
"1322","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab khandaq khodi gayi to main ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) mein sakht bhook dekhi. Phir main apni biwi ki taraf lauta. Phir main ne kaha: Kya tumhare paas kuchh hai? Kyunke main ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) mein sakht bhook dekhi hai. Phir us ne meri taraf thaili nikali jis mein jau ka sa' tha. Aur hamari paltu bakri thi. Phir main ne use zibah kiya. Aur us ne jau peesi. Phir wo mere farigh hone tak farigh hui. Aur use us ki handi mein kaata. Phir main Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki taraf mutawajjah hua. Phir us ne kaha: Mujhe Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) aur jo Aap ke sath hain un se ruswa na karna. Phir main Aap ke paas aaya aur Aap se sargoshi ki. Phir main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Hum ne apni bakri zibah ki hai. Aur jau ka sa' peesa hai jo hamare paas tha. Phir tum tashreef lao aur tumhare sath chand afrad. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne pukara. Phir farmaya: Ae khandaq walo! Beshak Jabir ne dawat banayi hai. Phir khush-aamdeed tumhe. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Apni handi na utarna, apna aata na pakana yahan tak ke main aaun. Phir main aaya. Aur Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) tashreef laye, logon ke aage, yahan tak ke main apni biwi ke paas aaya. Phir us ne kaha: Tum se aur tum se. Phir main ne kaha: Main ne wo kiya jo tum ne kaha. Phir us ne Aap ke liye aata nikala. Phir Aap ne us mein thooka aur barkat di. Phir hamari handi ki taraf gaye. Phir us mein thooka aur barkat di. Phir farmaya: Rotiyan pakane wali ko bulao taake mere sath pakaye. Aur apni handi mein se pyalon mein dalo aur use na utaro. Jabke wo hazaar they. Phir Allah ki qasam khata hun ke unhon ne khaya yahan tak ke chhora aur phire, jabke hamari handi ubal rahi thi jaisi thi. Aur hamara aata pak raha tha jaisa tha."
"1323","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Abu Talha ne Umm Sulaim se kaha: Beshak main ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki awaz kamzor suni hai. Us mein bhook pehchanta hun. To kya tumhare paas kuchh hai? Unhon ne kaha: Haan. Phir unhon ne jau ki rotiyan nikalein. Phir apni ek odhni nikali. Phir roti ko us mein se kuchh mein lapeta. Phir use mere hath ke neeche dabaya aur mujhe us mein se kuchh odhaya. Phir mujhe Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki taraf bheja. Unhon ne kaha: Phir main use lekar gaya. Phir main ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko masjid mein paya jabke Aap ke sath log they. Phir main un par khada hua. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne mujh se farmaya: Tumhe Abu Talha ne bheja? To main ne kaha: Haan. Aap ne farmaya: Khane se? To main ne kaha: Haan. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne un se farmaya jo Aap ke sath they: Utho. Phir chale aur main un ke aage chala yahan tak ke Abu Talha ke paas aaya aur unhe khabar di. Phir Abu Talha ne kaha: Ae Umm Sulaim! Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) logon ke sath tashreef laye hain. Hamare paas jo hum unhe khilayein nahi hai. To unhon ne kaha: Allah aur Us ke Rasool zyada jante hain. Phir Abu Talha chale yahan tak ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se mile. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) tashreef laye jabke Abu Talha Aap ke sath they. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Lao ae Umm Sulaim! Jo tumhare paas hai. Phir wo wo roti layein. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne us ka hukm diya aur wo todi gayi. Aur Umm Sulaim ne kuppi nichodi aur use saalan banaya. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne us mein jo Allah ne chaha farmaya. Phir farmaya: Dus ko ijazat do. Phir unhon ne unhe ijazat di. Phir unhon ne khaya yahan tak ke sair ho gaye, phir nikle. Phir farmaya: Dus ko ijazat do. Phir unhon ne unhe ijazat di. Phir unhon ne khaya yahan tak ke sair ho gaye, phir nikle. Phir farmaya: Dus ko ijazat do. Phir unhon ne unhe ijazat di. Phir unhon ne khaya yahan tak ke sair ho gaye, phir nikle. Phir farmaya: Dus ko ijazat do. Phir tamam qaum ne khaya aur sair hue. Aur qaum sattar ya assi mard thi."
"1324","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ek darzi ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko apne banaye hue khane ke liye bulaya. Anas bin Malik ne kaha: Phir main Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sath us khane ke paas gaya. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas roti aur shorba rakha gaya jis mein kaddu aur khushk gosht tha. Phir main ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko dekha ke Wo pyale ke ird-gird kaddu talash kar rahe they. Unhon ne kaha: Phir main us din se kaddu pasand karta raha."
"1325","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Ja'far bin Abi Talib (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko tari khajoor kakdi se khate dekha."
"1326","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar se Jabala ke hawale se riwayat hai ke hum Madina mein Iraq walon mein se kuchh ke paas they. Phir hamein qehet laga. Phir Ibn al-Zubair hamein khajoor dete. Phir Ibn Umar hamare paas se guzarte aur farmate: Beshak Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne milakar khane se mana farmaya, magar tum mein se mard apne bhai se ijazat le."
"1327","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sa'd (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate suna: Jo subah saat ajwa khajoorein khaye usے us din zeher aur jadu nuqsan nahi dega."
"1328","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sa'id bin Zaid (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Khumbi mann mein se hai. Aur us ka pani aankh ke liye shifa hai."
"1329","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hum Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sath karaunda todte they. Aur beshak Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Us mein se siyah lo. Kyunke wo sab se umda hai. Unhon ne kaha: Kya tum bakriyan charate they? Aap ne farmaya: Aur kaun sa Nabi hai magar us ne unhe charaya hai?"
"1330","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke ek shakhs Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaya. Phir Aap ne apni biwiyon ki taraf bheja. To unhon ne kaha: Hamare paas pani ke siwa kuchh nahi. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Kaun isے milayega ya mehmaan banayega? Phir Ansar mein se ek mard ne kaha: Main. Phir wo use apni biwi ke paas le gaya. Phir us ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke mehmaan ki izzat karo. To us ne kaha: Hamare paas mere bachchon ke khane ke siwa kuchh nahi. Us ne kaha: Apna khana tayyar karo, apna chiragh roshan karo, apne bachchon ko sulao jab wo raat ka khana chahein. Phir us ne apna khana tayyar kiya, apna chiragh roshan kiya, apne bachchon ko sulaya. Phir wo khadi hui goya apna chiragh durust kar rahi ho. Phir use bujha diya. Phir wo dono use dikhane lage ke wo dono kha rahe hain. Phir wo dono bhooke soye. Phir jab subah hui to wo Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas subah gaya. To Aap ne farmaya: Allah aaj raat hansa ya tum dono ke kaam par ta'ajjub farmaya. Phir Allah ne ye nazil farmaya [aur apne aap par tarjeeh dete hain agarche unhe hajat ho. Aur jo apne dil ki kanjoosi se bachaya jaye phir wahi kamyab hain]."
"1331","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abd al-Rahman bin Abi Bakr (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hum Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sath ek sau tees they. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Kya tum mein se kisi ke paas khana hai? Phir ek mard ke paas sa' bhar khana ya is jaisa tha. Phir gundha gaya. Phir ek mushrik mard aaya jo bikhre baalon wala lamba tha, bakriyan hankte hue. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Bai ya atiya, ya farmaya: Ya hadiya? Us ne kaha: Nahi, balke bai. Phir Aap ne us se bakri khareedi. Phir banayi gayi. Aur Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne kaleji bhunne ka hukm diya. Allah ki qasam! Ek sau tees mein se koi na tha magar Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne us ke liye us ki kaleji ka tukda kaata. Agar hazir tha to use diya. Agar ghayab tha to us ke liye chhupaya. Phir us mein se do pyale banaye. Phir wo sab ne khaye. Aur hum sair hue. Phir dono pyale bache. Phir hum ne use oont par uthaya, ya jaisa Aap ne farmaya."
"1332","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abd al-Rahman bin Abi Bakr (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Suffa wale faqeer log they. Aur Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jis ke paas do ka khana ho wo teesre ko le jaye. Aur chaar hon to panchwan ya chhatha. Aur Abu Bakr teen lekar aaye. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) dus lekar chale. Unhon ne kaha: Phir wo main, mere walid, walida, biwi aur khadim hun jo hamare aur Abu Bakr ke ghar ke darmiyan tha. Aur Abu Bakr ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas raat ka khana khaya. Phir thehre jahan Isha parhi gayi. Phir laute aur thehre yahan tak ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne raat ka khana khaya. Phir aaye jab raat mein se jo Allah ne chaha guzar chuka tha. Un ki biwi ne un se kaha: Tumhe tumhare mehmaanon se kis ne roka? Ya unhon ne kaha: Tumhare mehmaan? Unhon ne kaha: Kya tum ne unhe raat ka khana nahi khilaya? Unhon ne kaha: Unhon ne inkar kiya yahan tak ke tum aao. Beshak unhe pesh kiya gaya aur unhon ne inkar kiya. Unhon ne kaha: Phir main gaya aur chhupa. Phir unhon ne kaha: Ae gunthar! Phir bura kaha aur gali di. Aur kaha: Khayiye, khushgawar nahi. Phir unhon ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Main use kabhi nahi khaunga. Allah ki qasam! Hum luqma na lete magar us ke neeche se us se zyada badhta. Unhon ne kaha: Matlab yahan tak ke sair ho gaye. Aur wo us se zyada ho gayi jo is se pehle thi. Phir Abu Bakr ne us ki taraf dekha. Phir wo jaisi thi ya us se zyada. Phir unhon ne apni biwi se kaha: Ae Bani Firas ki behan! Ye kya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Nahi, meri aankh ki thandak ki qasam! Wo ab is se pehle se teen guna zyada hai. Phir Abu Bakr ne us mein se khaya. Aur farmaya: Ye to shaitan se tha, matlab apni qasam. Phir us mein se luqma khaya. Phir use Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas uthaya. Phir wo subah Aap ke paas thi. Aur hamare aur qaum ke darmiyan ahad tha. Phir muddat guzar gayi. Phir hum ne barah mard taqseem kiye, un mein se har mard ke sath log they. Allah zyada janta hai har mard ke sath kitne. Phir wo sab ne us mein se khaya, ya jaisa Aap ne farmaya."
"1333","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Do ka khana teen ko kafi hai. Aur teen ka khana chaar ko kafi hai."
"1334","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Beshak momin ek aanton mein khata hai. Aur kafir ya munafiq saat aanton mein khata hai."
"1335","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke ek shakhs bahut khata tha. Phir musalman hua. Phir kam khata tha. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se zikr kiya gaya. To Aap ne farmaya: Beshak momin ek aanton mein khata hai. Aur kafir saat aanton mein khata hai."
"1336","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne khane mein kabhi aib nahi lagaya. Agar chahte to khate, warna chhorte."
